{"unit_id":"tangwenhao616-netizen__dsh-anywhere#card-zh","repo":"tangwenhao616-netizen/dsh-anywhere","commit":"6c6954a546e2d5341011ddcfab311cce657ec5f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-anywhere 是面向 DSH Web 的远程机器接入插件，提供 fleet 入网和 SSH 工作区两种模式。fleet 模式通过管理面板登记自有中继，把 NAT 后的机器接入为可用的 dsh-ssh 主机；world 模式将远端 SSH 主机注册为会话文件系统和子进程服务，让文件读写与命令在远端执行。它还提供机器申请、批准、拒绝、吊销和工作区启动入口，并支持 POSIX 与 Windows 远端实现。适合需要从 DSH 管理异地机器或把远端主机作为工作区的用户。需要可用的 DSH、系统 SSH，以及 fleet 模式下自备中继；world 模式需配置远端登录信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/fleet.js:19-20","lib/fleet.js:38-61","lib/world.js:33-39","lib/fs-ssh.js:18-35","lib/subprocess-ssh.js:28-43"]}
{"unit_id":"tangwenhao616-netizen__dsh-anywhere#card-en","repo":"tangwenhao616-netizen/dsh-anywhere","commit":"6c6954a546e2d5341011ddcfab311cce657ec5f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-anywhere connects remote machines to DSH Web by SSH. Fleet enrolls NATed machines as dsh-ssh hosts through your relay; world runs session file and command operations remotely. A web panel manages machines and workspaces. Requires DSH, system SSH, remote login details, and a relay for fleet mode.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/fleet.js:19-20","lib/fleet.js:38-61","lib/world.js:33-39","lib/fs-ssh.js:18-35","lib/subprocess-ssh.js:28-43"]}
