{"unit_id":"tangwenhao616-netizen__dsh-anywhere#feature-1","repo":"tangwenhao616-netizen/dsh-anywhere","commit":"6c6954a546e2d5341011ddcfab311cce657ec5f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-anywhere 的功能「远端文件系统」：把 SSH 主机注册为 DSH 文件系统服务，支持解析路径、读取文本和字节、列目录、写入与编辑文件。使用会话文件工具时，输入路径和内容，操作由远端实现处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/world.js:33-39","lib/fs-ssh.js:18-35"]}
{"unit_id":"tangwenhao616-netizen__dsh-anywhere#feature-2","repo":"tangwenhao616-netizen/dsh-anywhere","commit":"6c6954a546e2d5341011ddcfab311cce657ec5f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-anywhere 的功能「远端进程执行」：将 DSH 子进程服务接到 SSH 主机，支持启动命令及终端进程。命令参数、工作目录和终端规格作为输入，远端执行并返回进程结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/world.js:33-39","lib/subprocess-ssh.js:28-43"]}
{"unit_id":"tangwenhao616-netizen__dsh-anywhere#feature-3","repo":"tangwenhao616-netizen/dsh-anywhere","commit":"6c6954a546e2d5341011ddcfab311cce657ec5f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-anywhere 的功能「NAT 机器入网」：fleet 路由接收新机器申请并完成入网编排，配置中继后把机器登记为 dsh-ssh 主机。用户从网页发起申请并批准配对，机器信息进入车队列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/enroll.js:27-68","lib/fleet.js:38-61"]}
{"unit_id":"tangwenhao616-netizen__dsh-anywhere#feature-4","repo":"tangwenhao616-netizen/dsh-anywhere","commit":"6c6954a546e2d5341011ddcfab311cce657ec5f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-anywhere 的功能「跨平台 SSH 工作区」：world 根据配置选择 POSIX 或 Windows 文件与进程后端，并将两者注册到 DSH 会话。用户提供登录主机、可选远端目录和平台配置，文件操作与子进程使用相应实现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/world.js:33-39","lib/fs-ssh.js:18-23","lib/subprocess-ssh.js:28-43"]}
